<title>USA: Rhone-Poulenc Rorer names Prache CFO.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer names Prache CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLLEGEVILLE, Pa. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc said it named Guillaume Prache as senior vice president and chief financial officer pending board approval.</p>
<p>Prache is currently senior vice president and chief financial officer the company's Agro unit. He replaces Patrick Langlois, who has been named chief financial officer of Rhone-Poulenc SA, with which Rhone Rorer is affiliated.</p>
<p>Both these changes will become effective on July 1.</p>
</text>
